</li>
			<li>Ensure that all your trades are executed as per your instructions.</=
li>
			<li>Insure you receive the payout of funds and securities within 1 worki=
ng day of settlement. In case you have chosen running account of funds, ens=
ure your account is settled on first Friday/Saturday of every month / quart=
